    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145070/extras/0656201fbc08e0e7f099b99b6ce5cb7a.avif?t=1734273211\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ever wondered what a quadrillion points of damage per second looks like?</strong> <strong>Now you can find out!</strong> <strong>Start the adventure and feel this power!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>At the beginning you click People to stun them to get their gold.</strong> <strong>You spend the gold to buy new items and not only deal more damage.</strong> <strong>The more damage you deal, the more gold you gain.</strong> <strong>Your power will grow exponentially and you will become the best in the world!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145070/extras/29cb1b0c036eb0ca28a930ab8b012340.avif?t=1734273211\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Buy 15 unique Items,</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Which will help you deal damage without clicking!</strong> <strong>Learn more and more legendary items.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145070/extras/2272747e061ea45c853035693d050df5.avif?t=1734273211\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The damage per second inflicted by the item will make your spend the collected gold to</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>get better and better and to become a legend ...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145070/extras/670fb87f3a9b06aaa49f9e2993e0d994.avif?t=1734273211\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0Click and defeat powerful enemies.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-15 unique Enemies.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145070/extras/09c3d39abb3165013c8ba2be81c7b4de.avif?t=1734273211\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<u>Attention to the bosses!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Need to do laundry or walk the dog?</strong> <strong>No worries!</strong> <strong>Your heroes will farm characters and automatically collect gold in your absence, even when the game is closed.</strong> <strong>But don't forget to come back and spend all that sweet gold on upgrades!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145070/extras/0656201fbc08e0e7f099b99b6ce5cb7a.avif?t=1734273211\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ever wondered what a quadrillion points of damage per second looks like?</strong> <strong>Now you can find out!</strong> <strong>Start the adventure and feel this power!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>At the beginning you click People to stun them to get their gold.</strong> <strong>You spend the gold to buy new items and not only deal more damage.</strong> <strong>The more damage you deal, the more gold you gain.</strong> <strong>Your power will grow exponentially and you will become the best in the world!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145070/extras/29cb1b0c036eb0ca28a930ab8b012340.avif?t=1734273211\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Buy 15 unique Items,</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Which will help you deal damage without clicking!</strong> <strong>Learn more and more legendary items.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145070/extras/2272747e061ea45c853035693d050df5.avif?t=1734273211\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The damage per second inflicted by the item will make your spend the collected gold to</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>get better and better and to become a legend ...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145070/extras/670fb87f3a9b06aaa49f9e2993e0d994.avif?t=1734273211\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0Click and defeat powerful enemies.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-15 unique Enemies.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145070/extras/09c3d39abb3165013c8ba2be81c7b4de.avif?t=1734273211\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<u>Attention to the bosses!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Need to do laundry or walk the dog?</strong> <strong>No worries!</strong> <strong>Your heroes will farm characters and automatically collect gold in your absence, even when the game is closed.</strong> <strong>But don't forget to come back and spend all that sweet gold on upgrades!</strong></p>",
